## 设计草案

### 1. `resolveUndoAction` — 解析回滚目标

```typescript
/**
 * 解析快照中单个文件的回滚目标
 * 
 * @returns
 *   - { action: "delete" }     → 新文件，应删除
 *   - { action: "restore", content } → 已存在文件，应恢复到该内容
 *   - null                     → 无法回滚（无历史内容），跳过该文件
 */
private async resolveUndoAction(
  file: SnapshotFile,
  snapshotId: string,
): Promise<
  | { action: "delete" }
  | { action: "restore"; content: string }
  | null
> {
  if (!file.existedBefore) {
    return { action: "delete" };
  }

  const content = await this.rebuildContentBeforeSnapshot(file.filePath, snapshotId);
  if (content === null) {
    return null;
  }

  return { action: "restore", content };
}
```

职责单一：只做**决策**（删还是恢复？恢复到什么内容？），不做任何 IO。

### 2. `applyUndoAction` — 应用快照

```typescript
/**
 * 执行单个文件的回滚操作
 * 
 * @returns "deleted" | "restored" 成功时，null 失败时
 */
private async applyUndoAction(
  filePath: string,
  resolved: { action: "delete" } | { action: "restore"; content: string },
): Promise<"deleted" | "restored" | null> {
  const log = getLogger();

  try {
    if (resolved.action === "delete") {
      if (existsSync(filePath)) {
        unlinkSync(filePath);
        log.info("CHECKPOINT", `已删除新文件: ${filePath}`);
        return "deleted";
      }
      // 文件已不存在，也算"成功"
      return "deleted";
    } else {
      await Bun.write(filePath, resolved.content);
      log.info("CHECKPOINT", `已恢复文件: ${filePath}`);
      return "restored";
    }
  } catch (err: any) {
    log.warn("CHECKPOINT", `${resolved.action === "delete" ? "删除" : "恢复"}文件失败: ${filePath} - ${err.message}`);
    return null;
  }
}
```

职责单一：只做 **IO 操作 + 日志**，不关心从哪里获取内容。

### 3. 重构后的 `undo()`

```typescript
async undo(): Promise<UndoResult | null> {
  if (!this.config.enabled) {
    return null;
  }

  const lastSnapshot = this.getLastSnapshot();
  if (!lastSnapshot) {
    return null;
  }

  const results: UndoResult["files"] = [];

  for (const file of lastSnapshot.files) {
    const target = await this.resolveUndoAction(file, lastSnapshot.id);
    if (!target) continue;

    const applied = await this.applyUndoAction(file.filePath, target);
    if (applied) {
      results.push({ filePath: file.filePath, action: applied });
    }
  }

  this.removeLastSnapshot();
  await this.saveIndex();

  return { snapshotId: lastSnapshot.id, files: results };
}
```

